<title>POLAND: Polish Impexmetal sets IPO minimum price at PLN 36.</title>
<headline>Polish Impexmetal sets IPO minimum price at PLN 36.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   Impexmetal SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares</p>
<p> Minimum price set at (PLN):	 36</p>
<p> Previous Pricing Range:	     36-41</p>
<p> IPO tranches:     No of shares offered   Subscription period</p>
<p> Large-investor	  2,657,643	    April 21-23</p>
<p> Employees		   531,528	    April 21-23</p>
<p> Sale of state shares: 2,976,560	    April 21-30</p>
<p>No of Existing Shares:7,441,400  </p>
<p>Lead Manager: Wielkopolski Bank Kredytowy (WBK) brokerage</p>
<p>Use Of Proceeds: investment in firms in holding, upgrade computer system, 20 percent of proceeds for paying debts  Earnings Data (million PLN)  1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net profit:		  20.7		    26.4</p>
<p> Pre-tax			49.0		    49.7</p>
<p> Sales			1.4 bln		1.1 bln</p>
<p>The firm has said it sees 1996 group sales at $1.2 bln. The state treasury currently holds all the firm's shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
